(text "J1 FRONT VIEW: latch below contacts; 1..4 left to right.\n1 BLACK/GND; 2 RED/3V3; 3 GREEN/SCL; 4 YELLOW/SDA." (at 35 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 353987b5-e74d-5bf6-9762-0824e1e61876))
(text "J2: 0.1 inch / 2.54 mm MALE\nJ3: JST-SH 1 mm TOP ENTRY (Qwiic)" (at 140 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ca629c63-df27-52af-9b5b-f30f993dca90))
(text "R1 = 0 ohm, 1206. Fit this link for SCL continuity.\nSDA passes under its insulated body on the front copper." (at 35 137 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 2ceaa515-30fc-5dc0-8fcb-f7d7653d5209))
(text "2 x 3.00 mm NON-PLATED holes.\nAll copper routing on F.Cu; no vias.\n3.3 V confirmed by user; no regulator or level conversion." (at 160 137 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6ff79894-315f-50bd-9216-50b7ec8e705f))
(text "Cable convention: plug nose away, cable toward viewer.\nLatch-side view YELLOW GREEN RED BLACK.\nContact-side view BLACK RED GREEN YELLOW.\nBefore powering the first assembled board, continuity-check\nactual cable colors against J2 labels, including both cable ends." (at 35 163 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 92f2e6d5-a044-551e-90bc-5478a8cf3df8))
